3381 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Option 1 \024 Brand\055aligned \050Aged Care Theme\051\nThis palette is expressive and closely tied to a warm\054 human\055centered identity\056\nKey characteristics\072\nPurple spectrum \050\0433B1260 \222 \043EDE4F6\051\072\050 Creates a soft\054 caring\054 and slightly premium feel\056 Purple often signals compassion and dignity\024important in aged care\056\nTeal \050\043007B87\051\072\050 Adds balance and a sense of trust and health\056\nAmber CTA \050\043F5A623\051\072\050 Warm and attention\055grabbing\054 suitable for buttons and key actions\056\nWarm cream \050\043FDF4D0\051\072\050 Keeps the interface gentle and non\055clinical\056\nCare gap red \050\043D94F3D\051\072\050 Highlights urgency or risk \050e\056g\056\054 unmet care needs\051\056\nOverall feel\072\050 Friendly\054 empathetic\054 and brand\055driven\056 It feels more like a care service platform than a formal system\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 3382 0 R
     /Pg 3090 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

