3383 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Option 2 \024 Formal \057 Government Ambience \050Selected\051\nThis palette shifts toward clarity\054 neutrality\054 and professionalism\056\nKey characteristics\072\nBlue spectrum \050\0431B3F6E \222 \043E3F1FA\051\072\050 Blue communicates trust\054 reliability\054 and structure\024very common in healthcare systems and government tools\056\nTeal \050\04300A79D\051\072\050 Keeps a healthcare tone while feeling slightly more modern and less emotional than the purple version\056\nGold CTA \050\043F5C842\051\072\050 More restrained than amber\024still noticeable but less \034urgent\035 or aggressive\056\nWarm cream \050\043FDF4D0\051\072\050 Maintains readability and softness\056\nCare gap red \050\043D94F3D\051\072\050 Retained for alerts and critical signals\056\nOverall feel\072\050 Structured\054 authoritative\054 and data\055focused\056 It feels like a decision\055support or policy dashboard\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 3384 0 R
     /Pg 3090 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
